1
00:00:00,600 --> 00:00:05,200
Biznesingizni internetga olib chiqmoqchimisiz?

2
00:00:05,800 --> 00:00:08,800
Sayt yasatish — qimmat, uzoq va murakkab.

3
00:00:09,000 --> 00:00:11,800
SavdoGO bilan esa hammasi bir necha daqiqada.

4
00:00:12,300 --> 00:00:15,900
Biznes turini tanlang, logo va rangni qo‘ying —

5
00:00:16,000 --> 00:00:19,700
sayt, savat va admin panel o‘zi yig‘iladi.

6
00:00:20,300 --> 00:00:23,800
Restoran, kiyim do‘koni, gullar, mebel —

7
00:00:23,900 --> 00:00:27,700
har qanday biznes uchun tayyor andozalar.

8
00:00:28,300 --> 00:00:31,800
Mijozlaringiz uchun telefonda ilovadek qulay do‘kon:

9
00:00:31,900 --> 00:00:35,700
qidiruv, savat, yetkazib berish va buyurtma kuzatuvi.

10
00:00:36,300 --> 00:00:39,800
Siz esa buyurtmalarni real vaqtda ko‘rasiz

11
00:00:39,900 --> 00:00:43,700
va mahsulot, aksiya, hisobotlarni bir joydan boshqarasiz.

12
00:00:44,300 --> 00:00:47,200
Yangi buyurtmalar — darhol Telegram’ingizga,

13
00:00:47,300 --> 00:00:49,800
kuryerlar esa jonli xaritada.

14
00:00:50,300 --> 00:00:52,600
Eng asosiysi — birinchi 10 kun bepul!

15
00:00:52,700 --> 00:00:54,600
Hamma imkoniyatlar ochiq, karta kerak emas.

16
00:00:55,000 --> 00:00:57,900
Keyin esa — oyiga atigi 199 000 so‘m.

17
00:00:58,000 --> 00:01:00,500
Yashirin to‘lovlarsiz, xohlagan payt boshlang.

18
00:01:01,100 --> 00:01:03,900
SavdoGO — do‘koningizni bugun oching!

19
00:01:04,000 --> 00:01:07,000
savdogo.uz — 10 kun bepul sinab ko‘ring
